 "offset_seconds": -3.6800000000001774,
 "words_heard": 247,
 "words": 250,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The troops were encamped against Gibbethon",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They heard that Zimri had struck down the king",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All Israel in the camp that very day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Proclaimed the commander Omri their new king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He bought the hill of Samaria from Shemer",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Built up the city with two talents of silver",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He named it after the owner of the ground",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A capital that would not be unbound",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people were split into two distinct sides",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Half followed Tibni son of Ginath to reign",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Half followed Omri in the battle lines",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Omri proved stronger than Tibni again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tibni died and the war was done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Omri became king in the thirty-first year of Asa",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He reigned twelve years in the northern land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Six years in Tirzah before he could rest",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He bought the hill of Samaria from Shemer",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Built up the city with two talents of silver",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He named it after the owner of the ground",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A capital that would not be unbound",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did evil in the eyes of the Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Acting more wickedly than all before him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He followed the sin of Jeroboam son of Nebat",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Provoking the God of Israel to anger",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With worthless idols that brought them shame",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Omri rested with his fathers",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Buried in Samaria",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His son Ahab took the throne",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Continuing the ways of the old",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
